id.instance: String (TS "c<n>")
num.game: i32
num.cursor: u32
map.ordered: IndexMap
bag.data: IndexMap<String, serde_json::Value>
error.style: Result<_, EngineError> with TS's message; panic only on invariants (switch_position is Result<(), EngineError>; ReduceResult.error is Option<String>)
null.optional: Option + skip_serializing_if
null.nullable: Option, serialised null
case.json: camelCase via serde rename_all
case.rust: snake_case
state.mut: &mut GameState writes, &GameState reads, &mut EngineSink for TS sink mutators
rng.source: Rng::new(&state.seed, state.rng_cursor) and write the cursor back
hook.style: Arc<dyn Fn(&mut EffectContext) -> Vec<Effect> + Send + Sync> via hook(); effects applied as (effect.apply)(&mut ctx); no fn pointers, no Box
registry.style: OnceLock set once by register_all; fused scripts built on lookup from state; tests use the testkit's thread-local register_catalog/register_scripts
async.style: tokio in crates/server only; none in pure crates
log.style: tracing JSON to stdout, server only
test.live_objects: owned CardInstance copies; re-read with find_instance, write with find_instance_mut
test.sink_for: local with_sink(&mut GameState, |&mut EngineSink| ..) from Rng::new + EngineSink::new; cursor written back only where TS did
test.default_params: scalar default/optional -> trailing Option<T> (None when omitted); options object -> owner's named struct, Default::default() when omitted
test.fixture_defs: lowercase TS fixture CardDef constants are fns returning CardDef (plain(), windfurier())
test.literals: events and results json_as(json!), actions frozen ActionBody variants, toMatchObject via a local matcher over serde_json::Value
view.clock: view_for_with_clock(&GameState, PlayerId, Option<i32>) beside SURFACE's two-argument view_for
